WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.380
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.960
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.170
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.470
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.560
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.720
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.720
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.730
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.060
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.320
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.900
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:34.910
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.230
<b>In My Way</b>

31
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.520
Why did you stop me?

32
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:56.880
I'm just trying to smash Law's head in!

33
00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.860
A clash of Conqueror's Haki!

34
00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:07.660
He can use it too?!

35
00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.940
Straw Hatter...

36
00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.980
I knew he had it!

37
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.900
Wh-Wh...

38
00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.020
What?!

39
00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.960
Everyone got knocked out?!

40
00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.120
That must be Haki!

41
00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.060
"Haki"?

42
00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:54.960
And what's more, it's the Conqueror's Haki!

43
00:02:56.380 --> 00:03:00.060
That's proof that you have the qualities of a king.

44
00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.840
Doflamingo!

45
00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:10.620
You're the man chosen by the heavens!

46
00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.080
Now...

47
00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:21.520
If you're really a man, then put yourself to the test.

48
00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:25.540
There someone out there you wanna kill?

49
00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.920
Do you want me to give you... the strength to take revenge?

50
00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.440
People I want to murder...

51
00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.000
There's so many!

52
00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:56.420
Doffy's different!
He's of a totally different caliber!

53
00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:02.960
His birth nurtured madness in him!
His fate fed him anger!

54
00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:06.680
Those things turned this man into the perfect demon!

55
00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:13.860
He is no less than the ultimate evil!

56
00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:21.450
I don't give a damn!

57
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.710
Mingo!

58
00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:06.000
Eat this!

59
00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.760
Mingo!

60
00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.540
Rubber...

61
00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:20.360
Doffy's madness will...

62
00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:25.020
destroy everything!

63
00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.800
Eagle...

64
00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:35.720
Bazooka!

65
00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.660
Athlete String!

66
00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:25.140
Sticky Stick!

67
00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.580
What the hell is this?!

68
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:40.540
You idiot! Don't think a weakling like you can beat Doffy!

69
00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.880
Dammit, let go of me!

70
00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:48.240
Now, Doffy, I'll stall Straw Hat.

71
00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.700
Trample Law's head while you have the chance.

72
00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.020
Hey! Don't do it, Mingo!

73
00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:03.160
Fight me! Traf can't even move a finger!

74
00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:05.080
I said, "wait for your turn"-

75
00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.650
Shut up! This jerk is so icky!

76
00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:08.940
Sticky, not icky!

77
00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.030
It's no use!

78
00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.910
What?! What's going on?!

79
00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:28.450
If he's a Logia user the Color of Arms should work!

80
00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:34.050
Well then, is my ability really a Logia-type?

81
00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.990
Either way, that crap doesn't work against me!

82
00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.050
You rubber idiot!

83
00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:41.910
Straw Hatter!

84
00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:48.250
He's right, that won't work on a papier-mâché bastard like him.

85
00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:54.150
P-P-Papier-mâché?!

86
00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:59.070
The main reason I didn't want to sit on the Seat of Hearts...

87
00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:03.530
was because I didn't want to be
lumped together with morons like them!

88
00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.130
So you can still move that mouth of yours.

89
00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.290
What're you saying, you talking corpse?!

90
00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:14.130
We top commanders are the foundation of the Family!

91
00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:17.910
I'll never forgive anyone for making fun of us!

92
00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.670
Sticky-Stick...

93
00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.790
Launcher!

94
00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.530
Stop! Traf can't even move!

95
00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.690
Law, you bastard!

96
00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.850
I gotta teach this brat a thing or two!

97
00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.680
Move, Doffy!

98
00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.570
Listen up, Law!

99
00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:47.610
Doffy will always be the one true king.

100
00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:50.330
However...

101
00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:55.410
We, the current top commanders, are his perfect equals!

102
00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.810
That's because...

103
00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:00.450
one day, some thirty years ago,

104
00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:07.270
the four of us acquired this immense gift that fell from the heavens!

105
00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:14.270
We granted him power,
and raised him to be a charismatic force for evil!

106
00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:21.970
You were almost killed in the Holy Land of Mariejoa?

107
00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.170
Even after bringing them your father's head?

108
00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:35.340
Even so, I'm glad that you came back alive!
It's a miracle!

109
00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:44.990
Doffy, you have the qualities of a king.

110
00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:52.200
Doffy. We swear to support you in everything.

111
00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:59.550
Doffy, in return, show us your dream.

112
00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.770
What's the matter, Doffy?

113
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.260
Where'd you get that wound?

114
00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:16.910
Some hoodlum did this. He should just die.

115
00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.210
Okay. I got it.

116
00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.110
The hell you want?

117
00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:38.210
Hey, hey, was it you who hurt Doffy?

118
00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:42.330
Oh, that brat.
I just teased him a bit!

119
00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:47.610
What's wrong?
Did somebody hurt you again?

120
00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:50.790
No, I just fell because the road was uneven.

121
00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.730
The road? Which town was it?

122
00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:59.330
Oh, I see. This needs to be repaired.

123
00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.310
Got it, Doffy?

124
00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.090
You're a king.

125
00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.750
Rebellion against you is forbidden.

126
00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:35.110
You're the man who will one day...

127
00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.550
rule as king of the seas!

128
00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:57.270
We set up Doffy as a king,
and proved his worth to all our subordinates!

129
00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:00.090
But the five of us; Doffy and the top commanders,

130
00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:02.950
all value the family equally,

131
00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.570
and we've raised it to its current status!

132
00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.310
Like a real family!

133
00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:11.650
Understand, Law?

134
00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:19.170
Do you remember that my mucus is flammable?

135
00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.810
I can shut that annoying mouth of yours instant-

136
00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.050
"Family"?

137
00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:30.050
It's only you guys who think that, Trebol.

138
00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:35.560
He doesn't give a damn about you guys.

139
00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.520
Wh-What did you say?!

140
00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:41.730
How pathetic.

141
00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:50.710
You act like you're his chief of staff, but to me you look like Doflamingo's foolish jester!

142
00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.810
F-F-Foolish jester?!

143
00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.390
Unforgivable!

144
00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:00.830
Hey, don't fall for it, Trebol!

145
00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:02.030
Room!

146
00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:05.030
You're inside his Room!

147
00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:10.790
This brat is barely alive as it is...
but I've also restrained his movement with my mucus!

148
00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.770
What can he do under these circumstances?

149
00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:17.400
Now, open your mouth!

150
00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.500
Stop!

151
00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:22.160
You insolent brat!

152
00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:29.350
I'll shove this down your throat and impale you!

153
00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:30.720
Stop!

154
00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:35.440
I'm a ship's captain, too!

155
00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:40.300
If I leave both you and Doflamingo
in Straw Hatter's hands,

156
00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.760
I'll lose face!

157
00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:46.600
You can't even move! What can you do?

158
00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.140
Damned worm!

159
00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.260
Die!

160
00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:54.200
Tact!

161
00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:57.230
What are you-

162
00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.300
His arm?!

163
00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.640
Sterben!
Blade of Death

164
00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:19.710
<b>4th Step
Flower Field</b>

165
00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.130
Is something wrong, Leo?

166
00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:28.530
<b>SMILE Factory</b>

167
00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:35.140
What's the matter, guys?
Everyone's facing the town all of a sudden.

168
00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.920
I-I don't know why, but...

169
00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:44.340
I feel like a huge load has been
lifted off my chest...

170
00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:48.900
Hey! We don't have time for that crap!

171
00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.700
We finished destroying the factory!

172
00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.580
We've gotta get away from the shrinking bird cage!

173
00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.630
<b>Royal Palace</b>

174
00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:15.650
What is that?!

175
00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:19.200
This super-skinny old guy
came out of the gooey stuff!

176
00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.420
So that's why my punch went right through his body!

177
00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.880
Curse you, Law...

178
00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.260
You damn fool!

179
00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.020
Law...

180
00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.660
You die as well!

181
00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.740
Oh, shit! He's gonna light us up!

182
00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:20.320
I'm taking you with me!

183
00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:36.420
The Royal Palace burst into flames!

184
00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.120
Luffy! Doflamingo is...

185
00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.510
Luffyland!

186
00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:48.100
Is he gonna be alright?
We gotta back him up somehow!

187
00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:52.840
I wouldn't do that, if I were you.
Frankly, you might cause him more trouble.

188
00:16:53.440 --> 00:17:00.040
Look! Even Trafalgar Law,
a Warlord of the Sea just like Doflamingo,

189
00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.500
has been gravely injured!

190
00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.180
Lawland!

191
00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.480
Luffy!

192
00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:09.160
Luffy! Send Traf-kun this way!

193
00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.700
Robin! Thanks for the help!

194
00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:14.520
Take care of him! Traf's done enough to corner Mingo!

195
00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.060
It can't be... his arm!

196
00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:21.470
Cien Fleur: Spider Net!
Hundred Flower: Spider Net

197
00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:39.490
Lawland's arm is...

198
00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:43.180
How terrible...
Traf-kun, stay with me!

199
00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:45.460
Nico Robin!

200
00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.280
Don't do anything unnecessary!

201
00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.800
He's still breathing.

202
00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:53.980
I haven't dismissed him yet.

203
00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.400
Doflamingo!

204
00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.840
That bastard's still going for Traf!

205
00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.120
I'll finish you off!

206
00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:03.900
Rubber...

207
00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.940
Bullet String!

208
00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:08.400
...Hawk Whip!

209
00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.550
Damn!

210
00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:14.680
Robiland!

211
00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.260
Traf! Robin!

212
00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.930
Precious Metal Axe!

213
00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:30.980
Cabbage-kun!

214
00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:33.930
I'm sorry. I just woke up.

215
00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:38.100
Haven't you settled this yet, Straw Hat?!

216
00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.880
Cabbage!

217
00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.920
Take everyone and get off this plateau!

218
00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.800
Don't be absurd!

219
00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:50.880
Doflamingo's standing right here in front of me!

220
00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:53.460
Let me get in at least one hit!

221
00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.220
I'm leaving everybody else in your hands!

222
00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:00.820
Le-Leave them in my hands?

223
00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.020
Trust...

224
00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.080
Respect...

225
00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:09.640
Popularity!

226
00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:15.830
Straw Hat's now my fan.

227
00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:20.820
A fan is asking me a favor...

228
00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.280
I can't turn it down!

229
00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:27.680
Bartolomeo should be on the lower level.

230
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.420
Let's use his powers to get down from here!

231
00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.140
Can you treat him somehow, Leo?

232
00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.830
The cut is ragged.

233
00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:45.640
If I can manage to sew him together...

234
00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.400
If you can do that,

235
00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:51.860
I can heal him with my Watering Can.

236
00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.600
In any case, we'd better do as Lucy said and head down.

237
00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.460
Hey, Bartolomeo!

238
00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.500
Make stairs with your barrier!

239
00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:03.420
Zoro-senpai!

240
00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.120
Forever!

241
00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.220
Are you even listening, you ass?!

242
00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.900
That's quite enough,

243
00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.040
Straw Hat.

244
00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:36.320
Law is suffering because he can't die.

245
00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.820
It's better to put him out of his misery.

246
00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:44.130
If that's what you wanna do, do it after you beat me!

247
00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:52.120
You're looking quite drained out as it is.

248
00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:53.760
Same goes for you!

249
00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:58.720
There's no way all those attacks from Traf left you without a scratch!

250
00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.540
Bazooka!

251
00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.370
You've definitely got speed, but...

252
00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:30.430
your attacks have no weight to them.

253
00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.100
Overheat!

254
00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.120
This brings back memories!

255
00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:45.060
Crocodile was defeated?

256
00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.040
By a captain from Navy HQ?

257
00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:52.360
Those liars. There must be a catch.

258
00:21:53.780 --> 00:21:56.020
See? It's gotta be him.

259
00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:58.980
His bounty jumped up.

260
00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.880
Find out about this crew. I've never heard of them.

261
00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:06.280
Monkey... "D."?

262
00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:12.600
And the Paramount War in which
you fell from the sky!

263
00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:22.580
I can't believe you survived and made it this far!

264
00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:43.940
Wait!

265
00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:47.520
You're awake, Trafalgar!

266
00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:52.220
Leave me... here!

267
00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:55.990
What are you saying?!

268
00:22:58.620 --> 00:23:00.820
For the past thirteen years...

269
00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.280
I've stayed alive just to kill Doflamingo.

270
00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:22.940
I've done... everything I can.

271
00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:29.580
I've gotta leave the rest to Straw Hatter.

272
00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:34.740
If he's gonna win,

273
00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:37.620
I want to witness it with my own eyes, here!

274
00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:49.900
If he loses, I need to be here and

275
00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:53.460
die along with him!

276
00:24:18.330 --> 00:24:19.650
I...

277
00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:23.540
got him involved in this fight.

278
00:24:27.620 --> 00:24:32.000
I wanna see this through, right here.
Just leave me!

279
00:24:34.260 --> 00:24:36.100
Trafalgar...

280
00:24:36.500 --> 00:24:37.570
Traf-kun...

281
00:24:38.200 --> 00:24:41.460
Captains in an alliance must be on equal footing.

282
00:24:43.360 --> 00:24:46.990
Luffy is here of his own free will.

283
00:24:47.940 --> 00:24:50.440
He won't fight if he doesn't have the will to do so.

284
00:24:52.860 --> 00:24:54.220
Leave me here...

285
00:24:54.600 --> 00:24:55.720
I'm begging you!

286
00:25:08.140 --> 00:25:10.340
I guess there's no talking you out of it, huh?

287
00:25:10.920 --> 00:25:13.020
Nico Robin, go on ahead.

288
00:25:16.080 --> 00:25:17.100
Cabbage-kun!

289
00:25:19.780 --> 00:25:22.120
I can't abide by a death wish.

290
00:25:22.860 --> 00:25:24.130
I'll stay here, too.

291
00:25:25.760 --> 00:25:27.380
You'll just have to deal with it.

292
00:25:28.300 --> 00:25:30.120
If you're gonna die,

293
00:25:31.240 --> 00:25:32.840
it's gonna be after me.

294
00:25:34.560 --> 00:25:37.150
Robin-senpai!

295
00:25:37.880 --> 00:25:38.640
Robin-san!

296
00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:41.720
Bartolomeo made us stairs!

297
00:25:42.120 --> 00:25:42.920
Go.

298
00:25:44.240 --> 00:25:45.950
Here, take this.

299
00:25:50.340 --> 00:25:52.780
Gear Third!

300
00:25:53.900 --> 00:25:56.680
Rubber...

301
00:25:57.450 --> 00:26:02.450
Grizzly Magnum!

302
00:26:06.080 --> 00:26:07.500
You're wide open!

303
00:26:19.960 --> 00:26:24.100
So you don't wanna let Law's attack go to waste, huh?

304
00:26:26.620 --> 00:26:29.140
How long will it take you...

305
00:26:29.470 --> 00:26:31.660
to take me down?

306
00:26:32.360 --> 00:26:35.820
You know, the one hour time limit...

307
00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:39.840
is the time you have left until the bird cage contracts completely.

308
00:26:44.840 --> 00:26:47.680
I'm sure there are people with bum legs.

309
00:26:47.740 --> 00:26:51.750
There are also the bedridden old people and suckling babies.

310
00:26:55.580 --> 00:26:58.730
Who will be the first victims?

311
00:26:59.820 --> 00:27:04.280
After 30 minutes,
casualties will begin appearing.

312
00:27:04.840 --> 00:27:10.340
After 40 minutes,
we'll start hearing their screams here.

313
00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:13.100
And after 50 minutes,

314
00:27:13.400 --> 00:27:18.710
the whole country will be covered in red, as though tomatoes were crushed.

315
00:27:23.160 --> 00:27:28.980
After an hour, there will not be a single voice left to be heard.

316
00:27:31.080 --> 00:27:36.580
I know that what happens to Dressrosa is none of your concern. However...

317
00:27:36.580 --> 00:27:40.840
Those meeting their end today will
bear grudges against the lot of you.

318
00:27:42.180 --> 00:27:47.940
If only you guys hadn't come here,
Dressrosa could have remained peaceful!

319
00:27:48.580 --> 00:27:51.580
Liar! It only looked that way!

320
00:28:02.620 --> 00:28:05.960
Wherever you go in the world,
you'll always find unfortunate souls.

321
00:28:06.200 --> 00:28:08.480
If you try to save them all, there's no end.

322
00:28:09.240 --> 00:28:13.480
You're just a pirate passing through, and you're gonna play hero?

323
00:28:14.280 --> 00:28:16.730
How dare you stand in my way!

324
00:28:17.060 --> 00:28:20.300
Wrong! You're in my way!

325
00:28:22.120 --> 00:28:27.000
You made my friends cry and my crewmates angry!

326
00:28:32.260 --> 00:28:34.740
But you still haven't gone down,

327
00:28:34.920 --> 00:28:36.820
so I'm taking everything upon myself!

328
00:28:37.200 --> 00:28:39.440
I won't let anybody die!

329
00:28:44.300 --> 00:28:47.660
You and your bird cage are standing in my way!

330
00:28:51.060 --> 00:28:52.080
Gear...

331
00:28:53.640 --> 00:28:54.980
Fourth!
